{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/a1e45e905ea48f289de8f2b074880613.avif?t=1761086901\" width=1280 height=739 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two paths to victory:</strong> Win votes OR crush your rival\u2019s Integrity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic daily events:</strong> Every day changes the rules of play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-building madness:</strong> Outreach, Response, and Sabotage cards + Wildcards (unreliable but huge payoff)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerups:</strong> Wear Campaign Buttons, Hire Staff Members, or unleash hell with Propagandas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Freedom:</strong> Stats, Buttons, Staffs Members, and your leftover Funds roll into your next campaign. <strong>OR not!</strong> That\u2019s totally up to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloc system:</strong> Voters with their own quirks, tolerances, and behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games:</strong> Quick twists like rock-paper-scissors, roulette, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller &amp; Steam Deck support</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/9f893238cc2e3b6495403805fd55c820.poster.avif?t=1761086901\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/9f893238cc2e3b6495403805fd55c820.webm?t=1761086901